      "snapshotData": "{\"text\":\"Skip to content Menu Home About Us Services Careers Contact Us About Us BIRD Consulting Services pioneers IT solutions with cybersecurity, AI, and data analytics expertise. With seasoned leadership boasting 30+ years of industry experience, we’re committed to addressing modern challenges and driving innovation for businesses worldwide. Join us to unlock the full potential of technology and propel your organization forward. Services BIRD Consulting Services offers specialized IT solutions encompassing recruiting, staffing, training, and expertise in cybersecurity, AI, data analytics, and more. IT Recruiting Identifying top tech talentto fuel organizational growth and success. Discover More IT Staffing Flexible solutions for seamless workforce augmentation and project support. Discover More IT Training Empowering professionals with cutting-edge skills for transformative career journeys. Discover More Key Differentiators: Our Unique Selling Propositions (USPs) Industry Expertise Decades of experience driving innovation and excellence in information technology. Cutting-Edge Training Programs Stay ahead of the curve with our industry-leading IT training. Tailored Solutions Customized IT services designed to meet your unique business needs. Focus on Innovation Driving transformative outcomes through forward-thinking strategies and solutions. Top Talent Acquisition Access to a vast network of skilled professionals for your team. Client-Centric Approach Dedicated to building strong partnerships and delivering exceptional results. Transform your business with Bird Consulting Services' innovative IT solutions. Contact Us Facebook-f Twitter Instagram Linkedin Quick Links Home About us Services Careers Contact Us Get In Touch +91 6300302165 info@birdconsultingservices.com BIRD Avenue, 4th floor, Plot no 84, Siddhi Vinayak Nagar, Madhapur, Hyderabad-500081 Telangana, India. Location © 2026 BIRD Consulting Services – All Rights Reserved Designed