      "snapshotData": "{\"text\":\"About Zipouch Our Products ▼ Slider U-Foil Food Wrapping Paper Cling Film Metallized Bag Sandwich Bag Zipper Bag Freezer Bag Smart Kitchen Wrap Recipes Contact Us + Food Wrapping Paper 100% Plastic Free View Product + Zipouch Slider Fresh-N-Loc View Product + Sandwich bag Keep you healthy View Product + U-foil Aluminium Foil View Product + Cling Film Microwave & Freezer Friendly View Product + Freezer Bag Keeps You Healthy View Product + Zipouch Zipper Fresh-N-Loc View Product + Metallised Film Keep Food Warmer View Product + Freezar Bag 10 Large Bags View Product Keeping your Food Fresh for a Long time... Highly Convenient, handy bags that keep your food fresh, easy to carry and increases shelf life... Our Products Sliders Quick-access bags for vegetables, fruits & meats Zipper Airtight, heavy-duty sealing for everyday use Metallised Bags Superior oxygen barrier for snacks & spices U-foil Keeps cooked meals warm for longer Cling Film High-stretch professional wrap for any surface Food wrapping paper Leak-resistant, grease-proof for meal prep Freezer Bag Aluminium-foil lined, designed for long-term freezing Sandwich bag Perfect for on-the-go snacks and lunches Smart Kitchen Wrap 2-in-1 foil and wrap for heat & storage Zipper Airtight, heavy-duty sealing for everyday use View Product ▶ Why Zipouch? Increases Shelf Life Increases shelf life of cooked meals, cut fruits & vegetables. Reduces Oxidation Reduces oxidation — the primary cause of flavour and texture loss. Odour-free Environment Creates an odour-free fridge environment — no cross-contamination. Keeps Pests Away Keeps pests away from pantry and dry storage. Professional-grade Technology Professional-grade freshness technology scaled for home use. A Little AboutUs... A Zipouch product is a UFlex product — born from 30+ years of packaging excellence trusted by major food manufacturers worldwide. Know more ► Reviews from Happy Customers Don't take our word for it — see what our 