      "snapshotData": "{\"text\":\"A Full Service Digital Marketing Agency Home Services Our Works Websites Design Portfolio Careers Internships Blog Contact Us About Us GA Digital Solutions is an Inbound Marketing and Sales agency offering services from branding to conversions and everything in-between: Healthcare We create visibility online for the practitioners of various specialties and drive footfalls to clinics or hospitals through our inbound marketing strategies E-commerce We execute end to end solutions to promote your product pan India online. Share with us your product, we do the rest to report sales conversions Real Estate We understand the investment dynamics of open plots, residential apartments and villas. All that we do is identify and schedule a site visit of a potential buyer Education We create visibility online for the students of various specialties and drive footfalls to institutions through our inbound marketing strategies People also ask What is Inbound Marketing? Inbound marketing drives customers to our platforms (website, social profiles, youtube channels, Google My Business, etc.,) by creating valuable content and experiences tailored to our target audience with an objective of initiating an interaction or offering a solution to their problem or requirement What is the significance of Inside sales? Inbound sales is responding to the enquiries generated from marketing activities, thus they are sales qualified leads with higher probability of conversions. In Inbound sales, the prospect expresses interest and initiates the sales process. The sales people acts as a consultant, addressing the prospects pain points, aligning the sales process to the buyer’s journey. Why should I outsource customer care? With the rapid digital transformation of businesses online post COVID, start-ups and mid-sized businesses can quickly scale up their operations outsourcing the functions of customer care as quick response rates to the customer interactions on webchats, social media, e-mail and support contact numbers helps in better customer experiences and conversions. What are the benefits of deploying marketing and sales tools? The marketing RoI can be maximized with an effective automation of leads flowing in from multiple marketing platforms, which helps in lead scoring, thus segmenting the sales qualified leads for the sales consultant to attend or follow-up for the sales closures. This rapidly increases the sales volume of each consultant. With automation of sales funnel, we also can analyse the RoI of various marketing channels. TESTIMONIALS About 30+ Happy Clients Reviews4.8 70 reviewsWrite a review We hired G A Digital Solutions to develop our website, and the experience was excellent from start to finish. The team was highly professional, understood our vision c...More...Srinivasareddy ThatipartiApril 21, 2026 Great team to work, delivered everything on time agreed!!rajesh madineniOctober 27, 2025 I have worked in the company for nearly 8 months, and as a fresher, it has been a great experience. The management is very friendly, and I worked on a single project w...More...PUSARLA Siva kalkiSeptember 9, 2025 We have given website development for our company, the work and the deliverables competed by the GA team is outstanding. Team is good in communication and they are ve...More...Mani AnandAugust 8, 2025 I really need to take a moment to appreciate the work that you guys did . I couldn’t be more impressed with GA Solutions’ website development work. From start to finis...More...Rithvik RishiJuly 15, 2025 Good team work and good responce Team members and organisationSatyanarayana ReddyJune 18, 2025 Nice Experience with GA Digital solutions.Satyanarayana ReddyJune 11, 2025 We engaged G A Digital Solutions for developing our website and company profile, and we are extremely pleased with the outcome. Their team was highly professional, res...More...CA Hiralal pallodMay 30, 2025 During my internship at GA Digital Solu