      "snapshotData": "{\"text\":\"About Zipouch Our Products ▼ Slider U-Foil Food Wrapping Paper Cling Film Metallized Bag Sandwich Bag Zipper Bag Freezer Bag Smart Kitchen Wrap Recipes Contact Us + Food Wrapping Paper 100% Plastic Free View Product + Zipouch Slider Fresh-N-Loc View Product + Sandwich bag Keep you healthy View Product + U-foil Aluminium Foil View Product + Cling Film Microwave & Freezer Friendly View Product + Freezer Bag Keeps You Healthy View Product + Zipouch Zipper Fresh-N-Loc View Product + Metallised Film Keep Food Warmer View Product + Freezar Bag 10 Large Bags View Product Keeping your Food Fresh for a Long time... Highly Convenient, handy bags that keep your food fresh, easy to carry and increases shelf life... Our Products Sliders Quick-access bags for vegetables, fruits & meats Zipper Airtight, heavy-duty sealing for everyday use Metallised Bags Superior oxygen barrier for snacks & spices U-foil Keeps cooked meals warm for longer Cling Film High-stretch professional wrap for any surface Food wrapping paper Leak-resistant, grease-proof for meal prep Freezer Bag Aluminium-foil lined, designed for long-term freezing Sandwich bag Perfect for on-the-go snacks and lunches Smart Kitchen Wrap 2-in-1 foil and wrap for heat & storage Zipper Airtight, heavy-duty sealing for everyday use View Product ▶ Why Zipouch? Increases Shelf Life Increases shelf life of cooked meals, cut fruits & vegetables. Reduces Oxidation Reduces oxidation — the primary cause of flavour and texture loss. Odour-free Environment Creates an odour-free fridge environment — no cross-contamination. Keeps Pests Away Keeps pests away from pantry and dry storage. Professional-grade Technology Professional-grade freshness technology scaled for home use. A Little AboutUs... A Zipouch product is a UFlex product — born from 30+ years of packaging excellence trusted by major food manufacturers worldwide. Know more ► Reviews from Happy Customers Don't take our word for it — see what our satisfied customers have to say about the lasting freshness Zipouch brings to their families. ❝ Zipouch has completely changed how I store my leftovers. Everything stays fresh for days longer than before. Priya, Delhi ❝ I love the sliders for organizing my veggies. They are durable, easy to use, and keep my fridge so neat. Rahul, Bangalore ❝ The U-foil is perfect for keeping my kids' school lunches warm. A must-have in our kitchen! Sneha, Pune ❝ I've tried many cling films, but this one actually sticks properly and seals tight without tearing. Vikram, Chennai ❝ Their freezer bags are top-notch. I no longer worry about freezer burn on my meats and frozen fruits. Samita M. < > Information About us Products Recipes Contacts Reach out Zipouch.mktg@uflexltd.com Tel: +91-9220339973 A-1, Sector 60, Noida Gautam Buddha Nagar, UP 201301 Powered By If you find the productsyou are interested in or havequestions? Just send us your contact email and we will contact you. Your Email → © 2026 — Copyright Terms & Conditions | Privacy Policy Designed and Developed by Two35 Playtform 137\"}",
