      "snapshotData": "{\"text\":\"A Full Service Digital Marketing Agency Home Services Our Works Websites Design Portfolio Careers Internships Blog Contact Us About Us GA Digital Solutions is an Inbound Marketing and Sales agency offering services from branding to conversions and everything in-between: Healthcare We create visibility online for the practitioners of various specialties and drive footfalls to clinics or hospitals through our inbound marketing strategies E-commerce We execute end to end solutions to promote your product pan India online. Share with us your product, we do the rest to report sales conversions Real Estate We understand the investment dynamics of open plots, residential apartments and villas. All that we do is identify and schedule a site visit of a potential buyer Education We create visibility online for the students of various specialties and drive footfalls to institutions through our inbound marketing strategies People also ask What is Inbound Marketing? Inbound marketing drives customers to our platforms (website, social profiles, youtube channels, Google My Business, etc.,) by creating valuable content and experiences tailored to our target audience with an objective of initiating an interaction or offering a solution to their problem or requirement What is the significance of Inside sales? Inbound sales is responding to the enquiries generated from marketing activities, thus they are sales qualified leads with higher probability of conversions. In Inbound sales, the prospect expresses interest and initiates the sales process. The sales people acts as a consultant, addressing the prospects pain points, aligning the sales process to the buyer’s journey. Why should I outsource customer care? With the rapid digital transformation of businesses online post COVID, start-ups and mid-sized businesses can quickly scale up their operations outsourcing the functions of customer care as quick response rates to the customer interactions on webchats, social media, e-mail and support contact numbers helps in better customer experiences and conversions. What are the benefits of deploying marketing and sales tools? The marketing RoI can be maximized with an effective automation of leads flowing in from multiple marketing platforms, which helps in lead scoring, thus segmenting the sales qualified leads for the sales consultant to attend or follow-up for the sales closures. This rapidly increases the sales volume of each consultant. With automation of sales funnel, we also can analyse the RoI of various marketing channels. TESTIMONIALS About 30+ Happy Clients Brand Identities Logo Design Brand Guidelines Brochure Design Website Services Website Design & Development Re-Design Services Maintenance Services Malware Removal Applications Development Web Applications Mobile Applications Content Marketing Content Development Content Marketing Services Search Engine Optimisation Social Media Management Performance Marketing Search Engine Marketing Social Media Marketing SMS Marketing E-mail Marketing WhatsApp Marketing Lead Management Services Inside Sales Customer Support Customer Engagement Reseller Services Domain Web Hosting & SSL Collaboration Services Podcast Printing Services Home About Us Blogs Careers Contact Us Disclaimer Privacy Policy © 2026 GA Digital Solutions. All Rights Reserved. Home About Us Services Our Works ▼ Websites Design Portfolio Blog Careers Internship Contact Us ☰ Digital Marketing Agency About Us GA Digital Solutions is an Inbound Marketing and Sales agency offering services from branding to conversions and everything in-between: Healthcare We create visibility online for the practitioners of various specialties and drive footfalls to clinics or hospitals through our inbound marketing strategies E-commerce We execute end to end solutions to promote your product pan India online. Share with us your product, we do the rest to report sales conversions Real Estate We understand the investment